  "text": "Altitude 2,500 meters. Wind gusts above 65 knots. Perimeter flak is tracking our approach. Port engine lock. Raising the forward barrier. Keep her steady while I take the flak. Catwalks at gantry 42. Narrow rails, but they run straight up the armor. I have our landing. That wind could peel a mech off the wall. Magnetize your boots. Check every tether twice. Cryogenic exhaust along the shaft. Expect black ice on the rails. Test your footing before you jump. Drone wings are launching from the silos above. The mainframe is sending everything it has down this wall. Cargo bay depressurized. Ramps deploying. After insertion, I will take the transport into cloud cover. One-way drop. We climb to the cyber nexus airlock. Stay on the hull, and we have a way through. Weapons armed, harnesses locked, Axiom force onto the catwalks. Begin the ascent.",
